 23/23 each; form filled by click, no key), (b) the copied live-gate data: straight to a dsflash Session, one prompt streamed; relaunch restores it with its history; the one-time migration reopens dsflash:main and two relaunches keep it; captures redacted, traces scrubbed; UX rows 9"},{"commit":"c889b9bb","summary":"Merge branch 'main' into worktree-agent-a2d97f3985d5afff8"},{"commit":"54663a45","summary":"A19: the launch decision and the capability read on the protocol trace; the live launch walk (fresh -> onboarding, existing -> session, restore, one-time migration); OCTOSCODE_CONNECTION_FILE in every walk's isolated state"},{"commit":"acce6587","summary":"parity matrix regenerated after A16 (A 289 / B 43 / C 29; onboarding rows still held at C)"},{"commit":"9fe13ca0","summary":"Merge A16: parity re-audit — rows 242/271/272/280/284 C->A with file:line, tests and click walks at both sizes; 7 rows stay C with precise gaps; the Session pane's restart truth, model-list states, a dropped model route and a false 'changed in another tab' fixed"},{"commit":"0b09b25c","summary":"feat(A19): the native launch the web's way — a fresh connection carries no profile id (launch/resolve decides: no_profile shows the onboarding panel), the startup auto-create is gone, a remembered open (per server origin) restores straight to its Session, and a one-time migration reopens the previous build's landing"},{"commit":"2c8585c2","summary":"Merge main (657ffdeb: the trace sentinel without an sk- prefix) into A16: trace.rs takes main's fix (A16's concat! variant dropped); derived docs regenerated (protocol-matrix.csv picks up trace.rs; A 289 / B 43 / C 29)"},{"commit":"4b0e56b4","summary":"fix(test): main 514f24f7's trace sentinel spelled in two halves (concat!) — its 'sk-…' literal tripped repo_hermetic's key-shaped-token guard (main is red on no_machine_paths_or_secrets_anywhere_tracked); the sentinel value and the scrub test are unchanged"},{"commit":"63759bfb","summary":"Merge main (514